REFERENCE  (J,ARI,230,112460,2026)
MONITOR    (22-TI-0(A,X)24-CR-51,,SIG)
SAMPLE     - Chemical-form of target is element.
           - Physical-form of target is solid.
METHOD     (ACTIV) Irradiated for 30 min.
           (GSPEC)
FACILITY   (ISOCY,2JPNIPC) AVF cyclotron
DETECTOR   (HPGE)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-1) target thickness
           (ERR-2) target purity
           (ERR-3) beam intensity
           (ERR-4) detector efficiency
           (ERR-5,,5.3) gamma-ray intensities (<5.3%)
           (ERR-S,0.4,52.) Statistical uncertainty (0.4-52%)
